/proof/one_line_verify_commands.md
  Link: <https://blayneaina.com/refusal-proof/>; rel="canonical"
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, follow

/proof/verifier_stdout_transcript.txt
  Link: <https://blayneaina.com/refusal-proof/>; rel="canonical"
